            条件に合うメニューが見つかりませんでした。検索条件を変更してください。
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto py-10 space-y-8">
  <header class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 via-blue-400 to-indigo-500 text-white rounded-3xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden">
    <div class="p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col gap-6">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] bg-white/20 px-4 py-1 rounded-full">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-300 animate-pulse"></span>
          1week meal planning
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold leading-tight"><%= weekRangeLabel %> の 7 DAYS PLAN を計画しよう！</h1>
        <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-white/80 max-w-2xl">
          AIが提案するメニューをカスタマイズして、この週の食事の予定を立てましょう
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-3xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
    <div class="px-6 py-6 space-y-5">
      <div class="w-full grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">
        <button type="button" class="w-full rounded-full bg-gray-900 text-white px-4 py-2 shadow-sm">🍽 メニュー計画</button>
        <button type="button" class="w-full rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-4 py-2">🛒 食材・調味料リスト</button>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 text-sm">
          <span class="text-gray-600 font-medium">選択中の週</span>
          <span class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900"><%= weekRangeLabel %></span>
        </div>
        <button type="button" data-action="regenerate-week" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gray-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow hover:bg-black focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gray-300">
          <span class="lucide w-4 h-4" data-lucide="refresh-cw"></span>
          全メニューを再生成
        </button>
